{"text": "In the first year, the prisoner suffered terribly from loneliness and boredom. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Day and night the piano could be heard from his room, and he read only light, easy novels. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the second year, the music stopped, and he asked only for the great classics. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the sixth year, he began studying languages, philosophy, and history with great passion. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The banker hardly had time to order the books he asked for. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In four years, about six hundred books were sent to him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Later he wrote that he had learned six languages and that his soul was filled with joy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After that, he read the Bible and books about religion for a long time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the last two years, he read everything without any order, science one day and poetry the next. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He read like a drowning man who grabs at one piece of wood after another.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "i", "r", "s", "t", " ", "y", "e", "a", "r", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "r", "i", "s", "o", "n", "e", "r", " ", "s", "u", "f", "f", "e", "r", "e", "d", " ", "t", "e", "r", "r", "i", "b", "l", "y", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "l", "o", "n", "e", "l", "i", "n", "e", "s", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "b", "o", "r", "e", "d", "o", "m", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "D", "a", "y", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "n", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "i", "a", "n", "o", " ", "c", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "b", "e", " ", "h", "e", "a", "r", "d", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "r", "o", "o", "m", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "h", "e", " ", "r", "e", "a", "d", " ", "o", "n", "l", "y", " ", "l", "i", "g", "h", "t", ",", " ", "e", "a", "s", "y", " ", "n", "o", "v", "e", "l", "s",